<title>USA: Montgomery Cty 7, Texas, won by S.W. Securities.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Cty 7, Texas, won by S.W. Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities said it won $1.190 million of Montgomery Cty MUD 7, Texas, waterworks and sewer system bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.646 percent.</p>
</text>
